Package: glitchtipr
Title: Error Tracking for 'R' Applications via 'GlitchTip' and 'Sentry'
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Arthur", "Bréant", , "arthur@thinkr.fr", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Captures, reports, and contextualises R errors in production
    applications. Sends error events to 'GlitchTip'
    (<https://glitchtip.com>) or any 'Sentry'-compatible error tracking
    platform using the 'Sentry' store API. Provides helpers to connect
    with a DSN, capture errors with full call stack context, and integrate
    with 'plumber2' HTTP routes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://hyperverse-r.github.io/glitchtipr/,
    https://github.com/hyperverse-r/glitchtipr
BugReports: https://github.com/hyperverse-r/glitchtipr/issues
Imports:
    httr2,
    plumber2
Suggests:
    httptest2,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    withr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Encoding: UTF-8
